info-paper-scp-082-content =
    Object Number: SCP-082
    
    Object Class: Euclid
    
    Special Containment Procedures: Enlarged residential quarters located within the Militarized Sector of Biosite 14 have been converted to suppress and calm SCP-082. Conventional weapons have a negligible effect on SCP-082. At present, the object believes it has been made King of France, and the containment zone is actually a royal palace created for its protection. All personnel interacting with it must be instructed on this ruse, as well as the fact that contradicting its understanding of the situation under threat of execution is prohibited. Guards and other personnel must treat it only as Class D.
    
    Operational Group F-1 is assigned to guard the object's room, but close contact with it is not permitted.
    
    Description: Object SCP-082 is genetically human; however, due to undefined processes (chemical, hormonal, cancerous, or supernatural), it has grown to a gigantic height of approximately 2.4 meters (about 8 feet) and weighs over 310 kilograms (about 700 pounds), with physical characteristics that are extremely disproportionate. It has a slightly pointed balding head, rounded cheekbones and cheeks, a bulbous nose, and dark sunken eyes, along with both excessive weight and a large volume of muscle mass. Its forearms are very muscular, measuring approximately 71 centimeters (about 28 inches) in circumference. The width of the fist along the knuckles is about 30 centimeters (about 12 inches). Although the object's legs are enormous, the feet are disproportionately small relative to the body (size 46).
    
    Object SCP-082 refers to itself as Fernando and speaks French with a strong English accent. Its appearance is further exacerbated by multiple scars all over its body (resulting from years of suppression in the containment zone). Its skin is dark and tanned, and although it refuses to bathe, it frequently changes clothes. When speaking, it forces words through abnormally large, compressed teeth. Object SCP-082 only opens its mouth when eating or singing, which it does quite often. It sings songs that bring it pleasure, ranging from forgotten Victorian-era bar songs to modern classics, usually during meals and food preparation. Object SCP-082 does not comb its hair, although it cuts and shaves it with a large knife used for food preparation. It should be noted that the object's hair is abnormally enlarged, with individual strands approximately one millimeter thick (while being as hard and looking like pencil graphite). Sometimes Object SCP-082 clenches its teeth so tightly that its gums begin to bleed. It remains unknown why it does this. X-rays are difficult to interpret due to the large muscle mass, however, scientists have discovered countless bullets, as well as several knives and swords, lodged in the object's body.
    
    The behavioral manner of Object SCP-082 is friendly and carefree. During containment, SCP-082 has accumulated a large wardrobe. It likes to dress in various fashions, including civilian clothes, military uniforms, clown attire, and women's clothing. New clothing must be delivered upon the object's request. It jokes quite often and communicates politely with personnel, frequently inviting them to lunch. Nevertheless, personnel must remember that at any moment Object SCP-082 may attack and eat them. Usually, before doing so, it apologizes for its manners and interrupts the conversation by tearing off its head. The powerful jaws of Object SCP-082 are strong enough to bite through bone, although it usually eats the longest bones first, then enjoys the skull. Its attacks are random and unmotivated—it does not matter whether it has eaten or not; this has no effect on its cannibalistic hunger.
    
    The greatest vulnerability of Object SCP-082 is that it is unable to distinguish reality from what it has seen on television or read in a book. Several times, the object expressed a strong desire to meet its idol, Hannibal Lecter, and believes that its favorite shows, such as "Law & Order," are real. Although it has shown high intelligence in the areas of memory and puzzle-solving, the essence of parody, satire, and fiction lies beyond its understanding. Object SCP-082, apparently, knows the essence of lies and can determine when those around it are lying to it, while at the same time telling an obvious lie when asked about its past.
